          "dimension": "Counterparty / Credit",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The BlackRock–Infinite Commerce incident demonstrates that private-credit portfolios can go from par to zero in a single quarter with no intermediate warning, a risk that crypto-collateralized lending platforms like BitGo and Spark Prime now inherit at institutional scale.",
